Package: QCGenomLandscape
Title: Portrait of Genomic Data Availability for Quebec Species
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Steve", "Vissault", , "svissault01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marie Pier", "Brochu", role = "aut"),
    person("Valérie", "Langlois", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Tools to query BOLD Systems and NCBI for genomic sequence
    availability across the species of the Biodiversite Quebec (BDQC)
    species list, cross-reference conservation status (COSEPAC/LEMV), and
    build summary tables and figures.
